\\\"You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">shouldn't</span> put hot water on a burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had better not</span> put hot water on a burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(There is no contraction.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ought not to</span> put hot water on a burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(There is no contraction.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">might not want to</span> put hot water on a burn.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(There is no contraction.)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Modals for Advice and Suggestions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to offer advice or give solutions to a problem, you use modals like <span class=\"italic\">might, must, should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">could</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at the chart below to see how to use these modals:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You should be able to manage your time. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You must know what your priorities are at each moment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Base Verb\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <br> You <br> He/She/It <br> We <br>\u2028They <br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br><span class=\\\"strong\\\">might<br> must<br> should<br>  could<br></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br><br>call\\\"}\",